.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# Scratch render output.
src/viewer/gallery/
src/viewer/out/
dist/_build/

# Rendered views are build output. `wb view ... -o out.html` regenerates any of
# them in one command, and three of them once accounted for 98% of the folder
# they were committed into. The root rule catches the renders the documentation
# tells a reader to produce, which otherwise land beside README.md.
/*.html
User artifacts/
Testing/manual/**/*.html
